{"status":"ready","content":"<think>\r\nMean = (25+10+0+9-1-14-21)/7 = 8/7\r\nDeviations:\r\n25 - 8/7 = 167/7\r\n10 - 8/7 = 62/7\r\n0 - 8/7 = -8/7\r\n9 - 8/7 = 55/7\r\n-1 - 8/7 = -15/7\r\n-14 - 8/7 = -106/7\r\n-21 - 8/7 = -155/7\r\n\r\nSquares: \r\n167² = 27889\r\n62² = 3844\r\n8² = 64\r\n55² = 3025\r\n15² = 225\r\n106² = 11236\r\n155² = 24025\r\n\r\nSum = 27889+3844+64+3025+225+11236+24025\r\n= 27889+3844 = 31733\r\n+64 = 31797\r\n+3025 = 34822\r\n+225 = 35047\r\n+11236 = 46283\r\n+24025 = 70308\r\n\r\nSum/49 = 70308/49\r\nSample variance = 70308/(49·6) = 70308/294 = 11718/49\r\n\r\ns = √(11718/49) = √11718/7\r\n\r\n11718 = 2·5859 = 2·3·1953 = 2·3·3·651 = 2·9·651 = 18·651 = 18·3·217 = 54·217\r\n217 = 7·31\r\nSo 11718 = 54·7·31 = 2·27·7·31 = 2·3³·7·31\r\n√11718 = 3√(1302) where 1302 = 2·3·7·31\r\nSo s = 3√1302/7\r\n</think>\r\n\r\n$$\\boxed{\\dfrac{3\\sqrt{1302}}{7}}$$\r\n","path":"responses/claude-opus-4-7/livebench-065-math.txt","size":814,"mtime":1779367582}